    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just \"feeling adrift\" though. it's like the engine is dead. the part of me that made me worth something, the part that actually mattered to people and the world... that's what died. it feels like i'm just occupying space now. there isn't even a \"me\" left to explore. it just feels pointless to keep trying to find someone who isn't there.",
