    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the \"silence\" sounds almost better than this. like, if the engine is dead, maybe there isn't any point in trying to force it to start again. it's just a lot of noise and struggle for nothing. do you ever think some people are just meant to reach an end point? like a story that's finished because there's nothing left to write?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
